{"3825520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spellgun Sprint", "steam_appid": 3825520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spellgun Sprint is a  speedrun shooter, meaning that levels are designed for players to figure out how to traverse as quickly and creatively as possible. The fastest times are recorded for all to see on the Steam Leaderboards. If you don't want to speedrun the game and just enjoy the story, you can opt out of the speedrunning features in the settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently four Speedguns that can be acquired by progressing through the game: the Howling Gale, the Ignition Point, the Aether Lance, and the Wood Shatterer. Each caters to a specific playstyle and has unique effects when overcharged. Additionally, you are equipped with Conjure Spells (Fire Flasks and Ice Knives) for extra offensive firepower, as well as a defensive Slow Time spell to help dodge and secure your footing. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spellgun Sprint is a  speedrun shooter, meaning that levels are designed for players to figure out how to traverse as quickly and creatively as possible. The fastest times are recorded for all to see on the Steam Leaderboards. If you don't want to speedrun the game and just enjoy the story, you can opt out of the speedrunning features in the settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently four Speedguns that can be acquired by progressing through the game: the Howling Gale, the Ignition Point, the Aether Lance, and the Wood Shatterer. Each caters to a specific playstyle and has unique effects when overcharged. Additionally, you are equipped with Conjure Spells (Fire Flasks and Ice Knives) for extra offensive firepower, as well as a defensive Slow Time spell to help dodge and secure your footing. </p>", "short_description": "Spellgun Sprint is a high-fantasy speedrun shooter with guns and magic! You are a wizard-artificer and you've just been kicked out of your own tower by a meddling druid seeking to destroy your life's work. Use your Spellgun technology to fight back and reclaim your home. Time is of the essence!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825520/7a48561d4330c50e0c3f828ec7c3b835d0b124c2/header.jpg?t=1768557612", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825520/b1a760db3df147cca1452533f64f40efff5b7a34/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768557612", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825520/b1a760db3df147cca1452533f64f40efff5b7a34/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768557612", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Team Spellslug"], "publishers": ["Team Spellslug"], "price_overview": {"currency": 